webframe provides CMake imported targets for server and desktop (Windows only) runtimes.

Usage in CMakeLists.txt:

    find_package(webframe CONFIG REQUIRED)

    # Link against the server runtime (all platforms)
    target_link_libraries(my_target PRIVATE webframe::server)

    # Link against the desktop runtime (Windows only)
    if(WIN32)
        target_link_libraries(my_target PRIVATE webframe::desktop)
    endif()

Use the WEBFRAME_MAIN macro in your application entry point:

    #include <webframe.hpp>
    WEBFRAME_MAIN(MyApplication)

For more information, visit: https://github.com/maxtek6/WebFrame
